{"title":"Ogre Butcher","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"q-alert-banner gg-alert\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>It lives on <b>Ogre Isle</b>, which you can only reach after finishing <a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-ogre-traitor\">The Ogre Traitor</a> (Gerald Seabroden).</span></p><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 40 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 5 times (2.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>52</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>43</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>47</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>54</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>5</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher?lv=39\" title=\"Pick level 39\"><td><b>39</b></td><td>185</td><td>26</td><td>1,950</td><td class=\"muted\">555 · 36.4 · 5,850</td><td>52</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher?lv=40\" title=\"Pick level 40\"><td><b>40</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>194</td><td>26.5</td><td>2,000</td><td class=\"muted\">582 · 37.1 · 6,000</td><td>43</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>41</b></td><td>203</td><td>27.1</td><td>2,050</td><td class=\"muted\">609 · 37.9 · 6,150</td><td>47</td><td>in the wilds around 307, -300</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>54</td><td>in the wilds around 296, -282</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>5</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>5</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ogre-butcher\" data-map-level=\"41\">Show level 41 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Ogre Cove</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 14</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-2013\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 35 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 299, -289 <span class=\"muted\">· 27 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 399, -182 <span class=\"muted\">· 16 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 250, -417 <span class=\"muted\">· 12 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 354, -200 <span class=\"muted\">· 11 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia%20Iron%20Mine\">Binxonia Iron Mine</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 217, -368 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ogre-butcher\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Ogre: <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth\">Ogre Youth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt\">Gaunt Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre\">Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(35)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler\">Ogre Mauler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(38)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger\">Ogre Charger</a> <span class=\"muted\">(42)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman\">Ogre Shaman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder\">Ogre Elder</a> <span class=\"muted\">(46)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain\">Mountain Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-warchief\">Ogre Warchief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(54)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"Ogre Butcher\"></div><h3>Ogre Butcher</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>41</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 40)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Ogre</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>203</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>27.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,050</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>183 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}